        {
          "kicker": "Breakdown battle",
          "heading": "Italy's Santamaria singles out Fiji's breakdown threat before Twickenham rematch for 11th",
          "body": "Roberto Santamaria, Italy's forwards coach, said the Azzurri came unstuck at the breakdown in the 21-16 defeat by Fiji in Udine. They conceded extra penalties for holding on and side entry against a team he knew excels at generating and exploiting turnovers. Every Italian sequence that broke the Fijian defence yielded only a penalty, he added, and one drive stalled a metre short. Italy, on seven straight defeats, meet Fiji again at Twickenham for 11th place."
