          "kicker": "Captain banned",
          "heading": "Sheehan banned for Australia play-off after Ireland's 20-17 win over Springboks",
          "body": "Ireland's captain misses Friday's Nations Championship play-off against Australia at Twickenham after a Tuesday disciplinary hearing handed him a two-week suspension for his croc-roll on Marco van Staden in Saturday's 20-17 win over South Africa. Sheehan, whose yellow was upgraded to red after the game, has accepted the ban, which also rules him out of Leinster's URC trip to Ospreys on 4 December. RTÉ reports slow ticket sales for the Twickenham game. Of the 30 fans in the app who answered after the Springbok win, 100% were buzzing."
