          "heading": "Italy scrum coach Santamaria pins 16-21 Fiji loss on breakdown penalties",
          "body": "Roberto Santamaria, the Italy forwards coach who specialises in the scrum, told Tuesday's press briefing that the breakdown undid the Azzurri. They conceded extra penalties for holding on and side entry against a side he noted excels at turnovers. He said every attack that unbalanced Fiji ended in a penalty Italy could not turn into tries, citing a drive stopped a metre short. With the Twickenham rematch deciding 11th or 12th place, he flagged workload management for a fourth game in four weeks."
