          "heading": "Scotsman column backs Grant Gilchrist recall for Scotland's Argentina finale",
          "body": "A Scotsman columnist has made the case for bringing Grant Gilchrist back for the Nations Championship finale against Argentina at Twickenham, calling Scotland's selection fascinating and flagging a big decision. Gregor Townsend has issues to weigh: he said he hoped Matt Fagerson's injury against Japan wasn't serious, and Stafford McDowall captained that win with Sione Tuipulotu and Rory Darge absent. Argentina are without Bautista Delguy, Mateo Carreras, Pablo Matera and the red-carded Mayco Vivas."
