          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Dan Edwards ruled out of Wales's Japan finale, still in a boot",
          "body": "The outside-half missed the 26-29 defeat to Australia with an ankle problem, remains in a boot and could face a spell on the sidelines. Forwards coach Danny Wilson had no full update but confirmed he was \"injured and not available.\" That leaves Sam Costelow, Joe Hawkins and Jarrod Evans contesting the No. 10 shirt for the Nations Championship finale. There was better news on Adam Beard: the second-row, absent against Australia with a shoulder injury, is back in full training."
