          "kicker": "Squad shake-up",
          "heading": "Matías Moroni recalled on 99 caps as Contepomi adds six for Scotland",
          "body": "Matías Moroni sits on 99 caps, so one appearance would make the centre only the second Argentina back to reach a century, after Nicolás Sánchez. He is one of six additions forced by a long casualty list: Mayco Vivas misses Scotland after his red card in Paris, Bautista Delguy (knee) and Mateo Carreras (shoulder) are injured, Santiago Chocobares is out and Pablo Matera is unavailable for personal reasons. Hooker Ignacio Ruiz and uncapped fly-half Juan Segundo Martín Montilla are also in."
